{"kind":"html","caption":"把 1、4、9 看作可重复使用的选择，令 dp[i] 表示凑出 i 所需的最少完全平方数个数。动画依次计算 1 到 12，并用递推式 dp[i] = min(dp[i - j²] + 1) 选择最优前驱。最终 dp[12] = 3，对应 12 = 4 + 4 + 4；同理计算到 13 时会得到 4 + 9，共 2 个。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>完全平方数动态规划演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.mono,.value,.formula{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff}\n.squares{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.square{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:11px}\n.formula-box{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.card{flex:1 1 120px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;min-height:44px}\n.card-label{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:2px}\n.card-value{font-size:12px;color:#d4d4d4}\n.dp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,38px);gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}\n.cell .index{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.current .value{color:#fff}\n.cell.previous{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.pending .value{color:#8d8d8d}\n.explain{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d2d;border-radius:4px;min-height:36px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.result{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}\n.term{padding:2px 7px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px}\n.plus{color:#8d8d8d}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>凑出 <span class=\"accent mono\">n = 12</span></h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">dp[i] = min(dp[i−j²]+1)，j² ≤ i</p>\n<div class=\"squares\"><div class=\"square mono\">1²=1</div><div class=\"square mono\">2²=4</div><div class=\"square mono\">3²=9</div></div>\n<div class=\"formula-box mono\">dp[0]=0</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">计算</div><div class=\"card-value mono\" id=\"target\">dp[1]</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">选择</div><div class=\"card-value mono\" id=\"choice\">1 = 0 + 1</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">最少个数</div><div class=\"card-value mono accent\" id=\"best\">1</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"dp-grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">从 dp[0] 加上 1²，得到 dp[1] = 1。</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"result\"><span class=\"term\">12</span><span class=\"plus\">=</span><span class=\"term\">4</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"term\">4</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"term\">4</span></div>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"mono\">dp[12]=3</span>；n=13 时为 <span class=\"mono\">4+9 → 2</span></p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst n=12;\nconst dp=Array(n+1).fill(Infinity),pick=Array(n+1).fill(0);\ndp[0]=0;\nfor(let i=1;i<=n;i++){\n  for(let j=1;j*j<=i;j++){\n    const sq=j*j;\n    if(dp[i-sq]+1<dp[i]){dp[i]=dp[i-sq]+1;pick[i]=sq;}\n  }\n}\nconst grid=document.getElementById('grid');\nfor(let i=0;i<=n;i++){\n  const cell=document.createElement('div');\n  cell.className='cell pending';cell.id='cell-'+i;\n  cell.innerHTML='<div class=\"index\">'+i+'</div><div class=\"value\">?</div>';\n  grid.appendChild(cell);\n}\nlet step=0;\nfunction render(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(c=>c.className='cell pending');\n  for(let i=0;i<=step;i++){\n    const c=document.getElementById('cell-'+i);c.className='cell';\n    c.querySelector('.value').textContent=dp[i];\n  }\n  if(step===0){\n    document.getElementById('cell-0').classList.add('current');\n    document.getElementById('target').textContent='dp[0]';\n    document.getElementById('choice').textContent='初始状态';\n    document.getElementById('best').textContent='0';\n    document.getElementById('explain').textContent='空和不需要任何完全平方数，所以 dp[0] = 0。';\n  }else{\n    const prev=step-pick[step];\n    document.getElementById('cell-'+step).classList.add('current');\n    document.getElementById('cell-'+prev).classList.add('previous');\n    document.getElementById('target').textContent='dp['+step+']';\n    document.getElementById('choice').textContent=step+' = '+prev+' + '+pick[step];\n    document.getElementById('best').textContent=dp[step];\n    document.getElementById('explain').textContent='选择平方数 '+pick[step]+'，从 dp['+prev+'] = '+dp[prev]+' 转移：dp['+step+'] = '+dp[prev]+' + 1 = '+dp[step]+'。';\n  }\n  document.getElementById('progress').style.width=(step/n*100)+'%';\n  step=(step+1)%(n+1);\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1800);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
